				<wikidot:authorName>Ihp</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1267048</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Yes, this is based off of <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/a-s-s-and-other-low-threat-groups-of-interest">this</a>, in part. The other half is because the term &quot;architectural zoologist&quot; popped into my head, and I found it amusing, but not amusing enough to do a full tale based around it. So, I cut this into segments of seminars from other careers that you know the Foundation would have, but nobody ever talks about.</p> <p>This is about 50% worldbuilding, 45% cringeworthy comedy, and 5% jokes people might actually like. I hope you guys at least can tolerate reading it.</p> <p>Thanks to everyone who looked over this in chat!</p> 
